In this practical, i've learner the following things : 
- Sitemap
- Wireframe
- Set up GitHub
- Initialization of Student-Hub Portal
- Requirement Analysis 

In sitemap, workflow is displayed that what will be the next step and how the website will work.
In Wireframe, page layout is created which roughly shows how the website will look.
In Github, repository named Student Hub is is created in which all the codes and related things are pushed to maintain records.
Requirement Analysis means the what are the user's requiremnets and the things need in in the website.
And at last all the things are pushed to GitHub repository.
